WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.448
Hi there, and welcome to Bite Wise! Local restaurants across the United States and Canada post their surplus food, like wrong orders and end-of-day extras, at up to seventy percent off.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:18.641
Create a free account with your ZIP code, or your postal code in Canada, then log in with your email or user name.

00:00:18.942 --> 00:00:25.150
You'll see the live deals closest to your ZIP code first, with a countdown showing how long each one is available.

00:00:25.453 --> 00:00:29.122
Search by dish, restaurant, city, or ZIP or postal code.

00:00:29.424 --> 00:00:31.643
Pick a deal, and choose how many you want.

00:00:32.558 --> 00:00:38.318
You see the full total before you order: the food, a small service fee, and any applicable taxes.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:43.721
Got a coupon from Bite Wise? Enter the code, and the discount comes right off your total.

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:48.154
Use your Bite Wise credit, and pay the rest with a saved or new card.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:55.068
Your card is only held for now. It's charged when you pick up your food.

00:00:56.059 --> 00:00:59.792
Done! You get a four-digit PIN. Show it at the counter when you pick up.

00:01:02.089 --> 00:01:04.989
Your orders and PINs are always under My orders.

00:01:06.043 --> 00:01:09.456
And every order comes with a receipt you can print or download.

00:01:09.933 --> 00:01:14.285
Here's how it works in real life. Order dinner on your phone, and get your PIN.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:19.811
Then head over to the restaurant, before the pickup window closes.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:30.873
At the counter, show your PIN. The staff check it and hand over your food, and only then is your card charged.

00:01:34.784 --> 00:01:39.136
That's Bite Wise. Rescue great food, and save money. Happy rescuing!
